Subject: How does reactiveValues differ from a list of reactive values? (unexpected req check)
Message-ID: <QhPxkcO7QwE.DTr4Lj_4AAAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/QhPxkcO7QwE/m/DTr4Lj_4AAAJ>
