Hi,

the inputIds are TL1, TL2, ... and so on. Therefore you should use input$TL1, input$TL2, ....:

  tlabels <- reactive({
    np  <- length(props)
    inp <- sprintf("TL%i", 1:np) # or <- paste("TL", 1:np, sep = "")
    ret <- rep('', np)
    for(i in 1:np) {
      ret[i] <- input[[inp[i]]]
    }
    return(ret)
  })

Whenever one of the text inputs changes then tlabels should return the current list of inputs for all text fields.

Best Sigbert
>

