Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hello,

Do you know if it's possible to have a navbarMenu inside a navbarMenu? When I run the following code, I don't have the option to select Histogram or scatter plot.

# ui.R
ui <- fluidPage(

  navbarPage("Shiny",

    tabPanel("Project"),

    navbarMenu("tools",

              navbarMenu("Visuals",
                      tabPanel("Histogram"),
                      tabPanel("Scatter plot")
                      ),

               tabPanel("model")
      )
   )
  )

# server.R
server <- function(input, output,session) {
}

shinyApp(ui = ui, server = server)

Thank you very much for your help!

Yann

