Subject: Using uiOutput inside a module/nested module
Message-ID: <rXOl5bn72hs.lhyT3f7UAgAJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/rXOl5bn72hs/m/lhyT3f7UAgAJ>
